        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kac nath dui̱rä",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nɛ̈nɛ jɛ, thɔ̱l ɛ jɛn le̱y mi pɛl kɛ pɛl mi wän wän rɛy le̱e̱yni diaal tin ci Kuoth Nhial ni Kuoth kɛ cak. Cuɛ ciek thi̱ec i̱, “A ci Kuoth yɛ cu jiök i̱, ‘/Cia bi mi̱th rɛy jiɛn kakä diaal?’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ciek ɛ loc i̱, “Dëëkɔ dɛy jiɛn kakä cam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ci Kuoth ɛ kulɛ lar ɛn ɣöö, /Cuarɛ mi̱th kɛ dɛy jiaath in te däär kakä, kä /cuarɛ jɛ cay guëër, mi wiaa jɛ cam bia li̱w.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä nɛ̈nɛ jɛ, cuɛ ciek cu jiök i̱, “Kacɛ jɛ, /cia dëë li̱w, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kɛ ɣöö ŋäc Kuoth ɛ ɛn ɣöö mi wiaa jɛ wä cam, bi wuɔ̱thkun lɛ̈p kä bia cu pa̱a̱r kɛ Kuoth kɛ ŋäcdun kɛ gɔy kɛnɛ jiäk.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inɔ, mëë ci ciek jiath car ɛn ɣöö ɛ mi dëë rɔ lot kɛ mi̱eth, kɛnɛ ɣöö gɔaa nëndɛ, kä di̱t lɔcdɛ kɛ jɛ kɛ ɣöö ɛ mi dëë pɛlran jak kä ro̱ŋ, cuɛ rɔ puɔ̱t dɔw jiaath ɛmɔ kä cuɛ jɛ cam, kä cuɛ gua̱n cieŋdɛ moc bä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kɛn diaal wuɔ̱thkiɛn rɔ̱ lɛp, kä cukɛ ta̱a̱ juutädiɛn cu mir, kä cukɛ ji̱th jiaath ŋɔa̱a̱p tak ni bieyni, kä cukɛ rɔ̱ kuäth kɛ kɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë jäl Kuoth Nhial ni Kuoth rɛy kakä kɛ nyaŋ thiaŋ, cu wut kɛnɛ ciekdɛ ja̱lɛ liŋ, kä cukɛ rɔ̱ wä tɛ̱̈ɛ̱̈ rɛy kakä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Kuoth Nhial ni Kuoth wut cu cɔl i̱, “Ji̱n a ni kä?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu wut jɛ loc i̱, “Cä ja̱lu liŋ rɛy kakä, kä cua̱ cu dual kɛ ɣöö thil ɣä kuum, cua rɔ cu tɛ̱̈ɛ̱̈.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë ci Kuoth mɔmɔ liŋ, cuɛ wut cu thi̱ec i̱, “Ɛŋa mi lär jɛ ji̱ ɛn ɣöö thil ji̱ kuum? A ci ku mi̱th jiaath ëë cä ji̱ luek thi̱n?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu wut jɛ loc i̱, “Ɛn ciek ëë ci kam ɣä i̱ bakɔ te kɛɛl, cɛ ɣä ka̱m dɔw jiaath ɛmɔ, kä cua jɛ cu cam.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛn wa̱nɔ cu Kuoth Nhial ni Kuoth ciek thi̱ec i̱, “Ɛ le̱e̱y ŋu ɛnɛ ci lɛl ɛ!” Cu ciek ɛ loc i̱, “Ci thɔ̱l ɣä mɛ̈t mi̱thdɛ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋuɔ̱k kuɔth kɛ lukdɛ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Kuoth Nhial ni Kuoth thɔ̱l ku jiök i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu wut ciöt ciekdɛ cɔl i̱ Iib, kɛ ɣöö ɛ man nɛɛni diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial ni Kuoth A-dam kɛnɛ ciekdɛ lät kä bieyni dua̱li, kä cuɛ kɛ kuäth kɛ kɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Tuk A-dam kɛnɛ Iib raar rɛy kakä E-dɛn",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn guäth ɛmɔ cu Kuoth Nhial ni Kuoth cu wee i̱, “Täämɛ, nɛ̈nɛ jɛ, ci raan cu ce̱tkɛ ram kɛl kä kɔn, ŋäcɛ mi gɔaa kɛnɛ mi jiääk. Bɛ te i̱di mi wä raam ɔ wä mi̱thikä jiaath te̱e̱kä kä bɛ cu tëk kɛ tëk mi do̱raar!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn cuɛ raan cu tuɔ̱k raar rɛy kakä E-dɛn kɛ ɣöö bɛ mun ëë ta̱thkɛ jɛ thi̱n wä pur. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn cuɛ wut tuɔ̱k raar rɛy kakä E-dɛn. Cuɛ puɔ̱ny mi ce̱tkɛ puɔ̱ny jääkä Kuɔth kɛnɛ mut mi rit rɔ kui̱cni diaal, la̱th kui̱ känyä ca̱ŋ kakä E-dɛn, gaŋkɛ duɔ̱ɔ̱p jiaath teekä.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
